<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish Oct producer output prices fall 0.3 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>Irish Oct producer output prices fall 0.3 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irish output prices for the manufacturing industries fell 0.3 percent in October and was down 1.2 percent from a year ago, Central Statistics Office data showed on Friday.  </p>
<p>		  Index (base 1985)   Monthly change   Yearly change</p>
<p>Latest month	   119.6		 -0.3		-1.2</p>
<p>Previous month	 119.9		 -0.2		-0.7</p>
<p>Year-ago month	 121.0		 +0.2		+3.9</p>
<p>-- Dublin newsroom 353 1 660 3377</p>
